/T (The Indian Institute of Space Science and Technology \(IIST\), located in Thiruvananthapuram, Kerala, is a premier institution dedicated to education and research in space science, technology, and engineering. Established under the Department of Space, Government of India, IIST provides a unique academic environment that integrates scientific learning with practical research and innovation. The institute encourages students to explore emerging technologies, develop technical expertise, and contribute to advancements in science and engineering. With a strong emphasis on research, innovation, and interdisciplinary learning, IIST nurtures aspiring scientists, engineers, and innovators.)
